  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHw/177",
  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">물과 식용유에 같은 열량을 가하였을때</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">온도변화는 같은가 다른가를&#160;</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">1학년 담당선생님들께서 실험 하시는데,</span><br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">제가 푹~ 빠져있는 </span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">과학센서(이지메이커)를 활용하여 실험할 수 있게</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">도와드렸습니다</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3f9b738a51df76d57f3ea8fd8a5087c31ad7d2ca\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3f9b738a51df76d57f3ea8fd8a5087c31ad7d2ca\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"435\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">핫플레이트에 물과 식용유를 각각 알루미늄컵에 담아 올려 놓습니다.</span><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1c2570757527bbdd1b1686d5eea048d431293739\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1c2570757527bbdd1b1686d5eea048d431293739\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"435\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">이지메이커 센서를 세팅합니다.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">수중접촉온도 센서 2개 = 3만원 X 2개 = 6만원</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">이지메이커 미니보드 1개 = 4만원</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">1개 조당 10만 예산이 있으면 실험이 가능합니다.</span><br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">이렇게 구성된 센서를 가지고 있으면&#160;</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">뜨거운물 차가운물에 의해 열평형되는 실험,<br>금속의 열전도 차이 확인하는 실험,<br>도 할 수 있습니다.</span><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ce5fcfbb5473a9225670aee314ce4881f2818bb1\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ce5fcfbb5473a9225670aee314ce4881f2818bb1\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"435\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">이지메이커 블록코딩을 합니다.</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bd900910e49dc0a0a0a2bd82c27323d301b774b2\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bd900910e49dc0a0a0a2bd82c27323d301b774b2\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"435\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">바로 측정되고 시각화되어 그래프가 그려집니다.</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3928081849d0d30a23d1e4701105e1caf6944c95\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3928081849d0d30a23d1e4701105e1caf6944c95\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"435\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7a34c3cc95a5eb3b3bb970e38eefac901aaf76a0\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7a34c3cc95a5eb3b3bb970e38eefac901aaf76a0\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"435\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/67a56c37d71059d9e9e8d7190b6289c38db6e6c3\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/67a56c37d71059d9e9e8d7190b6289c38db6e6c3\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"435\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/36b2f538114a71ea5a15053654a91cbf42180e7c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/36b2f538114a71ea5a15053654a91cbf42180e7c\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"435\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9db884ad90c9a2579112bc7865b08c0fe6d69fbf\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9db884ad90c9a2579112bc7865b08c0fe6d69fbf\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"435\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">처음에 물과 식용유가 온도가 같았는데, </span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">식용유의 온도가 많이 올라갑니다.</span><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">이지메이커를 이용해서</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">이것저것 확인해보는 실험을</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">많이 해보고 있습니다 ^^</span></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
